# VYMOD core governance

VYMOD is a premium consumer vehicle intelligence and security app. SYNQDRIVE Core is authoritative for vehicle identity, DIMO integration, telemetry, and analytics.

## Non-negotiables

- Read `AGENTS.md` and affected docs in `architecture/`, `compliance/`, `standards/` before coding.
- No direct SYNQDRIVE production DB access; no reimplementation of Core analytics.
- No vehicle enrollment from client-supplied identifiers alone.
- No provider credentials on mobile clients.
- Fail closed on auth and entitlement errors.
- User-visible strings only via i18n keys (`de-DE`, `en-US`); missing keys must fail CI.
- Never log precise GPS/location history by default.
- Do not claim regulatory compliance without evidence.

## Quality gates

Run `npm run validate` before claiming done. Report NOT_IMPLEMENTED checks openly.

Module changes require `architecture/MODULE_REGISTRY.md` consistency.
